'''Bahlokdaan''' is a feldgrau-green [[ON:Dragon|dragon]] who serves as an underling of [[ON:Kaalgrontiid|Kaalgrontiid]]. When first encountered, he has attacked [[ON:Star Haven Adeptorium (Elsweyr)|Star Haven Adeptorium]]. You are tasked with grounding him with the dragonhorn and distracting him, though he flies off afterwards.

You'll face off with him for a final fight during the [[Online:The Battle for Riverhold|Battle]] for [[Online:Riverhold|Riverhold]].
{{NewLeft}}

