==Quest-Related Events==
===Bright Moons, Warm Sands===
Bahlokdaan is first encountered after you have finished sparring with [[ON:Grand Adept Ma'jha-dro‎‎|Grand Adept Ma'jha-dro‎‎]]. He flies up and burns the adeptorium as the [[ON:Euraxians|Euraxians]] invade the premises. When you reach Dragonhorn Tower and sound the horn, Bahlokdaan will shriek and crash-land inside the Adeptorium, where he will be fought.
:'''Bahlokdaan''': ''"Burn, fools!"''
:'''Kaalgrontiid''': ''"Bahlokdaan, return to my side!"''
:<Bahlokdaan flies off>
:'''[[ON:Zamarak|Zamarak]]''': ''"The beast departs. Quick, let us leave."''

