Once you have dealt with the undead, a rage of dragons will arrive in the skies above Riverhold. Bahlokdaan will be among them, along with [[ON:Mulaamnir|Mulaamnir]] and [[Online:Kaalgrontiid|Kaalgrontiid]]. After [[ON:Khamira|Khamira]] confronts Kaalgrontiid, he will have Bahlokdaan stay behind to deal with the defenders. The green dragon will land on the roof of [[ON:Tajirri's House|Tajirri's House]], conveniently in range of a nearby ballista.

After he is hit by a bolt, he will land in the center of the market:
:'''Bahlokdaan''': ''"A cowardly attack! Bahlokdaan will crush you!"''

During the fight:
:'''Bahlokdaan''': ''"Bahlokdaan needs no wings to crush you!"''{{vn|found in LANG file}}

Once he is slain, his body will remain within the town for some time afterwards. It will be guarded by [[ON:Defense Force Warrior|Defense Force Warriors]], with some hold rakes meant to soon dispose of the giant beast.

==Skills and Abilities==
;Bite: A basic melee attack.
;Headbutt: A basic melee attack.
;Fierce Chomp: Bahlokdaan rears his head before chomping down. This can be blocked to mitigate the brunt of the attack.
;Sweeping Breath: Bahlokdaan breathes out fire in a large area in front of him, indicated by a moving conical [[ON:AoE|AoE]].
;Unrelenting Force: Bahlokdaan shouts at you, knocking you away. This can be blocked to prevent the knockback.
;Earth Spike: Bahlokdaan shouts at you, causing a spike of molten rock to jolt from under you, dealing damage and immobilizing you until the spike goes away.
;Rift Pull: Bahlokdaan fans his wing, sending out multiple flame swirls away, indicated by moving circular areas of effect. If you are in melee range, you are also hit and knocked away.
;Flame Aura: During the entire fight, Bahlokdaan is surrounded by an aura that deals constant damage if you stand close.

